  "description": "A double-buffered TUI framework for .NET console applications: GUI-like controls (input fields, output logs, menus, checkboxes, radio groups, dialogs and frames), anchor-based layout that rescales with the terminal, syntax highlighting for Markdown, C#, JSON, shell and diffs, a rendered Markdown preview, a side-by-side diff viewer, a Git changes overview, slash commands with tab completion, global key bindings, text animations, and clipboard support for both text and images.",
